# Files in this directory that must never be uploaded as public assets.
#
# Wrangler reads assets from disk, not from git, so .gitignore does not apply:
# a macOS .DS_Store sitting here was uploaded and served at /.DS_Store — a
# public listing of every filename in the directory, including any that were
# never meant to be linked. Ignored here instead, which is the only list
# `wrangler deploy` actually consults.
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
